  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IFCA contribution to the SME Finance Facility in Central Asia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The Action&apos;s main objective is to provide incremental long-term financing to SMEs in order to allow them to invest more in their production and trading capacity. Tha Action will have two windows: Direct Support Window for loans, guarantees and quasi-equity (e.g. mezzanine capital) to SMEs directly and Financial Intermediaries Window for loans or guarantees to SMEs through PFIs.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
